      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey. so i just got out of my appointment with the specialist. they confirmed it. career's over, knee's done. i don't even know why i'm opening this app right now\n\nbasketball has been my whole life since i was 9 years old. like literally everything. i wake up, i think about ball. i go to sleep thinking about ball. my whole identity, all my friends, my schedule, my money, my WORTH as a person — all of it was tied to being a player\n\nand now it's just... gone. i'm 26. i don't know who i am without this. i genuinely don't see the point of anything going forward. feels like everything that mattered is just done",
